{"id": "EUVD-2026-104575", "enisaUuid": "8fd19936-7f23-3365-8006-85ca5c9305bd", "description": "Parse Server before 8.6.98 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.3-alpha.1 does not enforce the create and addField class-level permissions of the _Session class when creating sessions. An authenticated user, or anyone holding that user's session token, can send POST requests to /sessions or /classes/_Session to create additional sessions for that user and add fields to _Session; these sessions are not revoked when the original session is logged out.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T19:10:49", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T15:35:25", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/parse-community/parse-server/security/advisories/GHSA-gj37-5hg5-p729", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/parse-server-before-8.6.98-and-9-x-before-9.10.3-alpha.1-session-class-level-permission-bypass"], "aliases": ["GHSA-98wm-hr36-cp8m", "CVE-2026-112769"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "56b396d7-938d-3318-9211-c8dc898fd5b0", "product": {"name": "parse-server", "vendor": {"name": "parse-community"}}, "product_version": "9.0.0 <9.10.3-alpha.1"}, {"id": "db6c0089-6105-3818-af42-b012ac4b778b", "product": {"name": "parse-server", "vendor": {"name": "parse-community"}}, "product_version": "0 <8.6.98"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "05d5738b-77e0-3ae3-a521-bb07f7a5e03e", "vendor": {"name": "parse-community"}}], "isExploited": false}